\par \noindent 8.【解析】求 $\triangle ABC$ 的面积。 \\ 先由正弦定律求 $AC$，再求 $\angle C$，用 $S=\frac {1}{2}\,BC\cdot AC\sin C$ 求面积。 \\ 设 $BC=a,\ AC=b$，则 \begin {align*} \frac {b}{\sin B} &= \frac {a}{\sin A} \\ b &= \frac {2\sqrt {6}\times \frac {\sqrt {2}}{2}}{\frac {\sqrt {3}}{2}} = 4 \\ \angle C &= 180^{\circ }-60^{\circ }-45^{\circ } = 75^{\circ } \\ \sin 75^{\circ } &= \sin (45^{\circ }+30^{\circ }) = \frac {\sqrt {6}+\sqrt {2}}{4} \\ S &= \frac {1}{2}\,ab\sin C = \frac {1}{2}\times 2\sqrt {6}\times 4\times \frac {\sqrt {6}+\sqrt {2}}{4} \\ &= \sqrt {6}\,(\sqrt {6}+\sqrt {2}) = 6+2\sqrt {3} \end {align*} 故选 C。\par \vspace *{1ex}
